Gettext: the gettext API of native language support, with libintl of
the package az.

The module gettext of PHP 8.1 for php81 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20210902/gettext.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php81/conf.d, its
headers in include/php81/php/ext/gettext.
